    <item>
      <title>OpenAI CFO称2027年上市，AI竞赛融资压力显现</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260819/OpenAI-CFO%E7%A7%B02027%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82AI%E7%AB%9E%E8%B5%9B%E8%9E%8D%E8%B5%84%E5%8E%8B%E5%8A%9B%E6%98%BE%E7%8E%B0/</link>
